  "text": "def largest_prime_factor(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return the largest prime factor of n. Assume n > 1 and is not a prime.\"\"\"\n    # Handle even numbers\n    while n % 2 == 0:\n        n //= 2\n    # Check for odd factors starting from 3\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= n:\n        while n % i == 0:\n            n //= i\n        i += 2\n    # If n is a prime number greater than 2\n    return n",
